    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p><strong>Hello Everyone!</strong> a new game is being develop, soon we will announce it!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Broken Minds is an experience, where you explore a story that actually happened in the real world.<br><br>You control a 13-15 year old boy named Kevin, who a long time ago, went through a traumatic event.<br>Your objective is to guide Kevin through this chaotic world called &quot;Voidgloom&quot;, and overcome &quot;something&quot; that is waiting for you, and wants to kill you.<br><br>that &quot;something&quot; is not your friend, and NEVER WILL BE, and if it is, maybe the worst will happen<br><br>(WARNING: This game will try to deceive you as many times as it can)",
